+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, development builds included, and this applies from now on with no exceptions for development. For testing, the project uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. HTTPS is used everywhere, with no plaintext fallback, and the project already has certificate management in place.
